        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>Social Distancing Infographic</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = {\n  tex: { inlineMath: [['$','$']], displayMath: [['$$','$$']] }\n};\n</script>\n<script id=\"MathJax-script\" async src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n<style>\n  * { box-sizing: border-box; }\n  body {\n    margin: 0;\n    background: #1b1464;\n    font-family: \"Segoe UI\", \"Helvetica Neue\", Arial, sans-serif;\n    color: #ffffff;\n  }\n  .page {\n    max-width: 1000px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    background: #1b1464;\n  }\n\n  /* ---------- Header ---------- */\n  .header {\n    background: #1b1464;\n    padding: 40px 60px 45px;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    gap: 22px;\n  }\n  .arrow-left, .arrow-right {\n    flex: 0 0 120px;\n    height: 2px;\n    border-top: 3px dashed #f7941e;\n    position: relative;\n  }\n  .arrow-left::before {\n    content: \"\";\n    position: absolute;\n    left: -14px; top: -8px;\n    border-right: 14px solid #f7941e;\n    border-top: 7px solid transparent;\n    border-bottom: 7px solid transparent;\n  }\n  .arrow-right::after {\n    content: \"\";\n    position: absolute;\n    right: -14px; top: -8px;\n    border-left: 14px solid #f7941e;\n    border-top: 7px solid transparent;\n    border-bottom: 7px solid transparent;\n  }\n  .title-script {\n    font-family: \"Brush Script MT\", \"Segoe Script\", cursive;\n    font-size: 62px;\n    line-height: 1;\n    margin-right: 6px;\n  }\n  .title-caps {\n    font-size: 48px;\n    letter-spacing: 10px;\n    font-weight: 400;\n  }\n\n  /* ---------- Two-column body ---------- */\n  .columns {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: stretch;\n  }\n  .col-left {\n    flex: 0 0 55%;\n    background: #191460;\n    padding: 40px 55px 60px 55px;\n  }\n  .col-right {\n    flex: 1;\n    background: #0f4c8a;\n    padding: 40px 55px 60px 45px;\n  }\n\n  .icon-circle {\n    width: 84px;\n    height: 84px;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    background: #f7941e;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    color: #ffffff;\n    font-size: 34px;\n    line-height: 1;\n  }\n\n  h2.section {\n    color: #f7941e;\n    font-size: 27px;\n    letter-spacing: 2px;\n    line-height: 1.25;\n    margin: 28px 0 14px;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n  }\n  p {\n    font-size: 16.5px;\n    line-height: 1.6;\n    margin: 0 0 14px;\n  }\n  .block-gap { height: 120px; }\n\n  /* Right column heading beside circle */\n  .right-head {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 26px;\n    margin-bottom: 40px;\n  }\n  .right-head h2 {\n    color: #f7941e;\n    font-size: 25px;\n    letter-spacing: 1.5px;\n    line-height: 1.25;\n    margin: 0;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n  }\n\n  .practice {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 26px;\n    margin-bottom: 46px;\n  }\n  .practice .placeholder {\n    flex: 0 0 78px;\n    width: 78px;\n    height: 78px;\n    border: 1px dashed rgba(255,255,255,.45);\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    text-align: center;\n    font-size: 9px;\n    color: rgba(255,255,255,.75);\n    padding: 2px;\n  }\n  .practice p { margin: 0; }\n\n  /* ---------- Bottom section ---------- */\n  .bottom {\n    background: #221a6e;\n    padding: 45px 60px 40px;\n  }\n  .bottom-head {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 30px;\n    margin-bottom: 26px;\n  }\n  .bottom-head h2 {\n    color: #f7941e;\n    font-size: 27px;\n    letter-spacing: 1.5px;\n    line-height: 1.3;\n    margin: 0;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n  }\n  .bottom-body { padding-left: 114px; }\n  .bottom-body p { margin-bottom: 22px; }\n\n  /* ---------- Footer ---------- */\n  .footer {\n    background: #1b1464;\n    padding: 30px 60px 40px;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: flex-end;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n  }\n  .source-title {\n    font-size: 12px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    letter-spacing: .5px;\n    margin: 0 0 8px;\n  }\n  .source-links {\n    font-size: 11.5px;\n    line-height: 1.7;\n  }\n  .made-with {\n    text-align: center;\n  }\n  .made-with .script {\n    font-family: \"Brush Script MT\", \"Segoe Script\", cursive;\n    font-size: 22px;\n    margin-bottom: 4px;\n  }\n  .visme-logo {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 10px;\n  }\n  .visme-logo .placeholder {\n    width: 46px;\n    height: 46px;\n    border: 1px dashed rgba(255,255,255,.45);\n    font-size: 8px;\n    color: rgba(255,255,255,.75);\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    text-align: center;\n  }\n  .visme-word {\n    font-size: 40px;\n    letter-spacing: -1px;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n\n  <!-- Header -->\n  <div class=\"header\">\n    <div class=\"arrow-left\"></div>\n    <div>\n      <span class=\"title-script\">Social</span><span class=\"title-caps\">DISTANCING</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"arrow-right\"></div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Two columns -->\n  <div class=\"columns\">\n\n    <!-- LEFT COLUMN -->\n    <div class=\"col-left\">\n      <div class=\"icon-circle\">&#10231;</div>\n\n      <h2 class=\"section\">What is Social<br>Distancing?</h2>\n      <p>Social distancing, also called physical distancing, is a form of <strong>non-pharmaceutical intervention</strong>, which downtrends the spread of contagious diseases simply by <strong>keeping people &ldquo;apart&rdquo; from each other.</strong></p>\n\n      <div class=\"block-gap\"></div>\n\n      <div class=\"icon-circle\">&#9432;</div>\n\n      <h2 class=\"section\">Why is Social<br>Distancing Important?</h2>\n      <p>It <strong>prevents contact between infected and uninfected individuals</strong>, resulting in reduced disease transmission and less deaths from fatal diseases.</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- RIGHT COLUMN -->\n    <div class=\"col-right\">\n      <div class=\"right-head\">\n        <div class=\"icon-circle\">&#10003;</div>\n        <h2>Best Practices for<br>Social Distancing</h2>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"practice\">\n        <div class=\"placeholder\">[Icon: house]</div>\n        <p><strong>Self/Home Quarantine: Stay home.</strong> Only go out if it&rsquo;s very essential, that too with protection (gloves, masks, sanitizers)</p>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"practice\">\n        <div class=\"placeholder\">[Icon: group of people]</div>\n        <p><strong>Avoid public gatherings</strong> as much as possible</p>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"practice\">\n        <div class=\"placeholder\">[Icon: storefront]</div>\n        <p>Keep spots susceptible to mass gatherings like <strong>parks, malls, food courts, restaurants and schools closed.</strong> Restaurants can be instructed to follow a &ldquo;Takeaway&rdquo; only system until the situation relaxes</p>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"practice\">\n        <div class=\"placeholder\">[Icon: measuring tape]</div>\n        <p>Maintain a distance of <strong>at least 1 - 2 meters (3 to 6 feet) from other individuals</strong></p>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"practice\">\n        <div class=\"placeholder\">[Icon: handshake]</div>\n        <p><strong>Avoid shaking hands</strong> and embracing one another</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Bottom section -->\n  <div class=\"bottom\">\n    <div class=\"bottom-head\">\n      <div class=\"icon-circle\">&#128200;</div>\n      <h2>Social Distancing in the Time<br>of COVID-19: Flattening the Curve</h2>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"bottom-body\">\n      <p>For a disease like COVID-19, which spreads through air droplets from sneezing and coughing, scientists have claimed that <strong>social distancing might &ldquo;flatten the curve&rdquo;.</strong></p>\n      <p>This means that if proper social distancing protocols are followed, the spread of the disease will <strong>slow down and relieve health care professionals and medical centers</strong> of the burden of providing aid to hundreds of patients at a time, which is not feasible.</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Footer -->\n  <div class=\"footer\">\n    <div>\n      <p class=\"source-title\">SOURCE:</p>\n      <div class=\"source-links\">\n        https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Social_distancing<br>\n        https://www.who.int/emergencies/diseases/novel-coronavirus-2019/advice-for-public<br>\n        https://www.vox.com/2020/3/15/21179296/coronavirus-covid-19-social-distancing-bored-pandemic-quarantine-ethics\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"made-with\">\n      <div class=\"script\">Made with</div>\n      <div class=\"visme-logo\">\n        <div class=\"placeholder\">[Logo mark]</div>\n        <span class=\"visme-word\">visme</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
